<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Doctoral Final Oral Defense Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h1, h2 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 100px; /* Placeholder size */
    height: auto;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .university-name {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .document-title {
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    min-width: 200px;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  .table-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .table-cell {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 5px 0;
  }
  .full-width-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <!-- Placeholder for Drexel University Logo -->
      <div class="logo"></div>
      <div class="university-name">DREXEL UNIVERSITY<br>Graduate College</div>
    </div>
    <div>D-5</div>
  </div>

  <div class="document-title">
    REPORT OF DOCTORAL FINAL ORAL DEFENSE FORM
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>This form must be filed with the Graduate College by the <span data-field="submission_deadline_type">{{ submission_deadline_type }}</span> by the <span data-field="submission_deadline_time">{{ submission_deadline_time }}</span>. In the case of disagreement within the Defense Committee, the Chair should consult with the Office of Graduate Studies. The deadline is typically the first day of final exams during the term in which the student plans to graduate. Please check with the <span data-field="graduate_college_name">{{ graduate_college_name }}</span> for exact term deadline.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>We have examined the following student who is pursuing a Ph.D/doctoral degree in <span data-field="doctoral_program_area">{{ doctoral_program_area }}</span>.</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>(Student Full Name)</div>
        <div>(Student ID Number)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>The results of the final dissertation defense on <span data-field="defense_date">{{ defense_date }}</span>:</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <label>&#9608;</label> <span data-field="defense_outcome_wore">{{ defense_outcome_wore }}</span> or <label>&#9608;</label> <span data-field="defense_outcome_not_satisfactory">{{ defense_outcome_not_satisfactory }}</span>.
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">(MM/DD/YYYY)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>Each committee member must sign this form to show either agreement with or dissent from the overall result.</p>

    <!-- Committee Member Signatures -->
    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Chair:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="chair">{{ chair }}</div>
          <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Signature</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Loop for other committee members -->
    {% for i in range(5) %}
    <div class="table-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
      <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
        <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member">{{ member }}</div>
        <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Signature</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <!-- Additional Member Slots (if needed, based on layout structure) -->
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member_2">{{ member_2 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member_3">{{ member_3 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member_4">{{ member_4 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member_5">{{ member_5 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member_6">{{ member_6 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>We dissent from the report:</p>
      <div class="full-width-line" style="margin-bottom: 10px;" data-field="we_dissent_from_the_report">{{ we_dissent_from_the_report }}</div>
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 15%;">Member:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 85%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="member_7">{{ member_7 }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>Authorizations/Signatures*</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 20%;">Chair:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 80%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="chair_2">{{ chair_2 }}</div>
          <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="chair_date">{{ chair_date }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 20%;">Supervising Professor (if not the Chair):</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 80%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="supervising_professor">{{ supervising_professor }}</div>
          <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="supervisor_date">{{ supervisor_date }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 20%;">Co-Supervising Professor (if applicable):</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 80%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="co_supervising_professor">{{ co_supervising_professor }}</div>
          <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="cosupervisor_date">{{ cosupervisor_date }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 20%;">Department Graduate Advisor:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 80%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="department_graduate_advisor">{{ department_graduate_advisor }}</div>
          <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="advisor_date">{{ advisor_date }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <div class="table-row">
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 20%;">Graduate College:</div>
        <div class="table-cell" style="width: 80%;">
          <div class="full-width-line" data-field="graduate_college">{{ graduate_college }}</div>
          <div style="text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">Date: <span data-field="college_date">{{ college_date }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 9pt;">
    <p>*Please Note: If corrections/edits are necessary, please sign, date, and submit this form once all corrections have been made by the student and approved by the committee.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Graduate College 3141 Chestnut Street Main 301 Philadelphia, PA 19104</p>
    <p>Tel: 215.895.0366 Fax: 215.895.0495 Email: <span data-field="college_email">{{ college_email }}</span> Web: <span data-field="college_web">{{ college_web }}</span> (Last Updated 3/1/2016)</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>